0..51 Comment "// Each declaration here is refused at its carrier."
52..54 Comment "//"
55..131 Comment "// A head takes only its own implicit `A`, so a supply of another name is an"
132..193 Comment "// error. An omitted carrier needs an endpoint that fixes it."
194..196 Comment "//"
197..268 Comment "// Each head refuses a supply of `B` as `UnresolvedName` at `B`. A flow"
269..337 Comment "// between two lambdas refuses as `ImplicitUnsolved`, since a lambda"
338..361 Comment "// synthesises no type."
362..364 Comment "//"
365..445 Comment "// - see: `../../model/identity/carrier-by-name.gandr` — the carriers admitted"
446..461 Comment "// - see: #4932"
